From d2e92b2f740bb311979af6637f9c5ba72590367b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Feb 2026 09:19:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add skill-matcher to Agent Skills category

skill-matcher is an intelligent skill recommendation and auto-activation
system for Claude Code that automatically analyzes user prompts and
recommends the most relevant skills.

Key features:
- Keyword-based matching across 6 categories
- Smart filtering to avoid trivial task recommendations
- External catalog search
- Bilingual support (EN/RU)
- Utility script for scanning local skills
---
 THE_RESOURCES_TABLE.csv | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

